# ic22_continuous_on_edges.lgi
# interpolate / continuous from the 2D triangle mesh of ic13 onto a
# 101 x 101 grid of points, many of which lie EXACTLY on an edge shared
# by two source triangles (found by the demonstration page, Oct 20
# 2026). Every point must get the exact linear value.
# Before the inside_tri2d fix of Oct 2026, 109 of the 10,201 points
# (on interior diagonal edges) were found in neither triangle and got
# the flag value (max + 1).
# check: linear | out_ic22.inp | fc
read / avs / src_tri.inp / mo_src
read / avs / sink2d_grid.inp / mo_snk
cmo / addatt / mo_snk / fc / VDOUBLE / scalar / nnodes
interpolate / continuous / mo_snk fc / 1,0,0 / mo_src flin
dump / avs / out_ic22.inp / mo_snk
finish
